</style>
<h2>Asobi Review 0.9 (build 863)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Asobi Review knows its connection.</b> On a hotspot or a slow link, an amber <b>SLOW CONNECTION</b> tag appears and anything heavy waits while the review copy plays. <b>Review &#9656; Network&#8230;</b>: the mode, <b>Measure Now</b>, and what is waiting &#8212; download it now, or all of it back at the hotel. When the connection turns fast, Asobi Review asks once.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
